    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/T-881E9A1vfmyRL0aWS31lq4kjp3XTCXlxC_gKro28Q.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nIn hydrogen azide, the bond orders of bonds (I) and (II) are ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
